   "y": 512.4,
   "width": 836.6,
   "height": 16.2,
   "text": "The stride counts the padding, which is how a row can be wider than its data. The bound is measured from global_addr,",
   "originalText": "The stride counts the padding, which is how a row can be wider than its data. The bound is measured from global_addr,",
